      en: ["The total length of the river is approximately 217 kilometers.", "The Chatkal empties into the Charvak Reservoir in Uzbekistan.", "Its valley forms the boundary between the Chatkal and Pskem ranges.", "The peak water discharge during summer can reach 711 cubic meters per second.", "It is ranked as one of the most challenging rafting locations in the CIS.", "Much of its upper basin lies within the Besh-Aral State Nature Reserve."],
