      en: ["The national park was officially established in 1996.", "The total area of the protected territory is 32,411 hectares.", "Besh-Tash Lake is situated at an altitude of around 3,000 meters.", "The park is inhabited by approximately 28 different mammal species.", "The maximum depth of the primary lake is 28 meters.", "The park safeguards rare plant species native to the Talas Alatau region."],
